              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='11000' id='34' type-v2='text' w='98814' x='593' y='7313'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='14'>L3 Buyable Rate Deepdive Table</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'>This page helps you identify the top 20 best-selling SKUs by level 2 category for a specific vendor or chain, on a weekly or monthly granularity.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Filters- </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'>Use the filters for </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7'>Date</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#4e79a7'>, </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7'>Country</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#4e79a7'>, </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7'>Chain</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#4e79a7'>, </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7'>Vendor</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'>, and </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7'>Ranking Level</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#4e79a7'>Æ </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'>to begin your analysis.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Ranking Levels Explained</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>  - Vendor:</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'> Shows the top 20 best-selling products for the </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>selected vendor</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'> (weekly or monthly).</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>  - Chain:</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'> Shows the top 20 best-selling products for the </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>entire chain</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'> (weekly or monthly).</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Metrics</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'>The metrics (orders, revenue, items sold, and availability) are specific to the chosen ranking level. For example, if you group the data by Vendor, the performance metrics will reflect the vendor&apos;s sales.</run>
